</div>
<div style="background:#f5f1e9;padding:24px 10px;"><div style="max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;padding:36px 34px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#161514;">
    <div style="margin-bottom:28px;color:#8b3d2e;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;">Asia-first museum & installation guide</div>
    <h1 style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:34px;line-height:1.12;font-weight:600;">Art World Weekly — September 4, 2026</h1>
    <p style="margin:0;color:#504c46;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;">This week prioritizes museum-scale exhibitions and installations that are genuinely worth leaving home—or planning a trip—for. Taiwan comes first, followed by the strongest Asia picks and only a few global projects that clear a higher travel bar.</p>
    <section style="margin:38px 0 0;">
    <h2 style="margin:0 0 20px;padding-bottom:9px;border-bottom:2px solid #111;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:25px;line-height:1.2;">Taipei &amp; Taiwan</h2>
    <article style="margin:0 0 28px;padding:0 0 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #e7e3dc;">
    <span style="display:inline-block;margin:0 0 8px;padding:3px 8px;border:1px solid #bbb;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Closing soon</span>
    <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;"><a href="https://www.mocataipei.org.tw/en/ExhibitionAndEvent/Info/Weeds%2ADon%E2%80%99t%2AObey" style="color:#111;text-decoration:none;">Weeds Don’t Obey</a></h3>
    <div style="margin:0 0 8px;color:#625d56;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;">MoCA Studio, Museum of Contemporary Art Taipei · Taipei, Taiwan</div>
    <div style="margin:0 0 9px;color:#8b3d2e;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;">2026-07-11 – 2026-09-20</div>
    <p style="margin:0;color:#292724;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;">Plants become a lens for migration, borders, trade and belonging. The premise is unusually sharp for a compact local exhibition and should reward a slower visit.</p>
    <p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:13px;"><a href="https://www.mocataipei.org.tw/en/ExhibitionAndEvent/Info/Weeds%2ADon%E2%80%99t%2AObey" style="color:#6d3d2d;">Official exhibition page →</a></p>
  </article><article style="margin:0 0 28px;padding:0 0 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #e7e3dc;">
    <span style="display:inline-block;margin:0 0 8px;padding:3px 8px;border:1px solid #bbb;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Open now</span>
    <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;"><a href="https://www.fubonartmuseum.org/Exhibitions" style="color:#111;text-decoration:none;">Old Masters from Rembrandt to Goya: Treasures from the Toledo Museum of Art</a></h3>
    <div style="margin:0 0 8px;color:#625d56;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;">Fubon Art Museum · Taipei, Taiwan</div>
    <div style="margin:0 0 9px;color:#8b3d2e;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;">2026-07-18 – 2026-10-19</div>
    <p style="margin:0;color:#292724;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;">The Toledo Museum loan show brings Old Master painting to Taipei at genuine international-museum scale. Included as the quality benchmark for this newsletter, even if you have already visited.</p>
    <p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:13px;"><a href="https://www.fubonartmuseum.org/Exhibitions" style="color:#6d3d2d;">Official exhibition page →</a></p>
  </article><article style="margin:0 0 28px;padding:0 0 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #e7e3dc;">
    <span style="display:inline-block;margin:0 0 8px;padding:3px 8px;border:1px solid #bbb;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Worth a trip</span>
    <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;"><a href="https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQY1BGckNzcjYyWmE2QWNHUldsTWJOZFdpaXVIbWtpTXkyMFo2Rlk5Q1dQN2JGeGtZcFA1aXp3Tkk4aWkwVkdRX0FoSGxEejJwaUt4VFpwTDktQWNSaThyVEUwanN5bEpONjdiR1pyMVpXTTd2OEpwNjI5TlBnTzh6WG5ud1BQTXBFN2FJQlh1UmoxN3hZOXhZVkFTQ2tBdW8?oc=5" style="color:#111;text-decoration:none;">China Withdraws from Gwangju Biennale over Taiwan Designation</a></h3>
    <div style="margin:0 0 8px;color:#625d56;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;">Taiwan · ArtAsiaPacific</div>
