  </article><article style="margin:0 0 28px;padding:0 0 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #e7e3dc;">
    <span style="display:inline-block;margin:0 0 8px;padding:3px 8px;border:1px solid #bbb;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Worth a trip</span>
    <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;"><a href="https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE5sdFBOdmRBQWtZNFBUUF9SSHNHZkRyOWZTcjJyVWhoWll0d0lxckhfQnczTWZCS1dYbS1zbTJWOU94SmxjLVRyeE52LVpJbGtzZlpudVFKY0pqZjNtWnl2U29KQlZxTXBobTVIcWRQcFIybXZuOU1pT0lheDc?oc=5" style="color:#111;text-decoration:none;">Taiwan name restored to Gwangju Biennale pavilion</a></h3>
    <div style="margin:0 0 8px;color:#625d56;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;">Taiwan · ArtReview</div>
